    "done_when": "In imas_ambix/agent/telemetry_retention.py, compare_tiers works on pairs of one UTC clock hour and one of the counters in COUNTER_NAMES (engine.generation_tokens, engine.prompt_tokens, engine.uncached_prompt_tokens), a row belonging to the hour that contains its sample timestamp: a tier is absent for a pair when none of its rows in that hour carries the counter (rows may exist), a pair absent in every tier is skipped, a pair present in some tiers and absent in others is a disagreement, and a pair present in all three tiers is compared and agrees when the raw, minute and hour totals are equal; a raw file is eligible for deletion only when, in addition to every existing gate (last-row age from row_span older than --older-than-days, unmodified for 24 h, job absent from the queue, compacted siblings present), at least one pair was compared and every compared pair agrees, and a file with no compared pair is kept with the reason 'no hour carries the counters'; render_listing and the JSON listing print, per file, the number of compared pairs and the number of distinct UTC hours holding at least one compared pair; tests in tests/test_telemetry_retention.py assert on fixtures that a hybrid file whose old-format hours carry no counters in any tier and whose other hours agree is eligible, that a pure old-format file with no compared pair is kept with that reason, that a pair present in raw and absent in the minute tier is refused, that a pair present in all tiers with unequal totals is refused, and that the listing shows the compared-pair and hour counts; gate: uv run --no-sync pytest -p no:cacheprovider tests/test_telemetry_retention.py passes, uv run --no-sync pytest -p no:cacheprovider tests/test_agent_serve_registry.py -k agent_package_modules_parse_with_serving_python passes with exactly 1 test selected, uv run --no-sync ruff check imas_ambix tests exits 0; the gate log's first line names the commit it ran at, each command is logged verbatim beside its own summary line and exit status as EXIT=N, and the gate runs in the foreground to its summary before the manifest is finalised",
